Node","statementID":"1064105001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……讲到这里，阿塔利娅大人降临我们恩莎村的故事就结束了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1064105002:1":{"key":"say:2:1064105002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人真是一位又善良又厉害的半神呀……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1064105003:1":{"key":"say:3:1064105003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了，路易莎奶奶，艾达修女后来去哪了？她好像不在我们村子里。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1064105004:1":{"key":"say:4:1064105004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾达修女呀……她加入了阿塔利娅大人治下的执刃修女团，作...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1064105005:1":{"key":"say:5:1064105005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"前段时间她还有写信回来，说她们协助阿塔利娅大人破坏了一...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1064105006:1":{"key":"say:6:1064105006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哇！好厉害！路易莎奶奶可以给我讲这个故事吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1064105007:1":{"key":"say:7:1064105007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"当然可以。不过现在，你得回家了，你爸爸已经来接你了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1064105008:0":{"key":"say:9:1064105008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"小安娜，该回家了，不要总是给路易莎奶奶添麻烦。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1064105009:0":{"key":"say:10:1064105009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"呵呵，没这回事。小安娜一向很听话。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1064105010:1":{"key":"say:11:1064105010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"就是就是，我可乖了！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1064105011:1":{"key":"say:12:1064105011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那就好。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1064105012:1":{"key":"say:13:1064105012:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105012","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好了，回家之前还有一件事要做，是什么？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1064105013:1":{"key":"say:14:1064105013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"——向艾雅女神祈祷！奶奶说的每句话我都记得很清楚！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1064105014:1":{"key":"say:15:1064105014:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105014","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"路易莎奶奶，我和爸爸去教堂里祷告了，再见！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1064105015:1":{"key":"say:17:1064105015:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105015","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"再见，可爱的小安娜。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:18:1064105016:1":{"key":"say:18:1064105016:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105016","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感恩您的慈悲与庇佑……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:19:1064105017:1":{"key":"say:19:1064105017:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"19","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1064105017","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……也感恩您对埃米妮一家的宽恕，与救赎。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:修女路易